Package: aruleRec
Title: Easy and Fast Recommendations With Association Rule Learning in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Henrik", "Varmer", email = "henrik@varmer.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: aruleRec wraps the 'arules' package to turn tidy (long) customer-item
    purchase data into per-customer cross-selling recommendations using
    association rule learning (apriori). The input data.frame must contain a
    customer ID column and a product ID column; column names and the rule-mining
    hyperparameters (confidence, support, minlen, maxlen) are supplied as
    arguments.
